        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": false,
        "si_used": true,
        "procedure": "Weigh 0.2 mmol Dy(OAc)3·6H2O (71.5 mg) and 0.2 mmol o-vanillin (30.4 mg) into a Pyrex tube (one end closed, about 20 cm). Add 55 µL triethylamine and 2 mL CH3OH, shake to mix, evacuate and seal the tube, and heat in an oven at 80 °C for three days. Cool slowly to room temperature; yellow bulk crystals precipitate on the tube wall. Yield about 63.45% based on Dy(OAc)3·6H2O; H2L1 yield about 14.4% based on cluster 1.",
